# CodeSync AI — Frontend Environment Variables (Optional)
# In local development, the app automatically derives the backend host and port (5000)
# from the browser's current window.location.hostname (e.g. http://192.168.1.105:5000).
# You only need to set these if using custom ports, remote domains, or tunneling services.

# VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:5000/api/v1
# VITE_SOCKET_URL=http://localhost:5000
# VITE_BACKEND_PORT=5000
